on><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/f4Xy5cnwm8zvTBekiagcGrnm2J4WolLhteS2PMGlREyl6dCicOnVJ6ExcEqAFKBCQK12fibs44Phhy1iaF3ypWiarCg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>暨南大学国际商学院位于美丽的暨南大学珠海校区。学院学科门类齐全，兼有管理学和经济学两大学科，大力推进“本硕博”三级人才培养体系的建设。</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>学院坚持国际化办学战略，与新西兰梅西大学、英国伯明翰大学等20多家国际一流高校建立密切的合作关系，积极开展学科共建、科研合作、师资交流、学生交换等。学院师资队伍不断壮大，科研实力不断增强，在高层次项目、高水平成果和服务地方经济发展方面成绩卓著。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/f4Xy5cnwm8zvTBekiagcGrnm2J4WolLhthpevGq1ibtQbCw91kkBj5e8ZYRfrNLVHDD0C84BqHM9oJTrGZoMdp0w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>展望未来，国际商学院将以粤港澳大湾区建设为契机，按照学校“双一流”和高水平大学建设的要求，进一步凝心聚力，开拓进取，着力打造面向未来，兼具国际化特色的创新型商学院，以立德树人为目标，培养具有全球视野、复杂问题解决能力超强的未来商业领袖和创新人才。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>学院现面向国内各高校接收2026年应届本科推免生报名</span></strong><strong><span>。</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>国际化商科人才的梦想大门已为您敞开，扬帆起航，逐梦国商，欢迎报考。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/f4Xy5cnwm8zvTBekiagcGrnm2J4WolLhtxOjICkPnzj8NRZq1IzvNHmxqY3lgonDxgoTLPChNf6F3iaDSU9b2trw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/f4Xy5cnwm8zvTBekiagcGrnm2J4WolLhtooUQkiaGDeVhc6gkj8A3KY977vFn4kdic0JEiaLrrZMCWACPdoEteUWeA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生信息</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>Enrollment Majors</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/f4Xy5cnwm8zvTBekiagcGrnm2J4WolLhtulQa2wtFYuLibzJa7wPNvjPM6gu1rcVFaVWgzTBdDCv9STJpibOdiagbg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>国际商务专业学位硕士研究生</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>Master of International Business</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>国际商务（025400）以培养服务国家重大战略和全球经济社会发展需求，具有国际视野和家国情怀，熟练掌握国际商务理论和专业技能，掌握跨国沟通能力和现代信息技术，通晓国际商务环境和规则，胜任在国内企业、跨公司、金融机构、咨询机构、政府部门和社会组织等从事国际商务经营与管理工作的应用型、复合型、创新型的高层次国际商务专门人才为目标。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>主要课程：</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>经济学理论与实践、中级国际商务、人工智能导论、商务外语、数据分析与软件应用、数字经济导论、国际投资与跨国企业管理、国际商务谈判、数字贸易、学术规范与论文写作等。（以实际开课为准）</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/PicpAvCuRsQHgBDIibDcjjwjdffxbmMUfM2NF7oVJEywITEyXRko7dh7uIXEkI770lYj8sT79MicpflVoSxQVDFjA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>国际商务学术学位硕士研究生</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>Master's degree in International Business</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>国际商务（1202J3）是一门以管理学和经济学为主要理论基础的新兴交叉学科，以培养具备一定的批判性思维和创新性思维，能从事科学研究工作或独立承担专业技术或管理工作，身负社会使命感、具有中华文化底蕴、符合现代商业教育规范、拥有国际视野，具备进一步深造的学术基础和科研技能的高素质研究型人才为目标。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>主要课程：</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>管理经济学、管理研究方法、跨国公司经营管理、实证研究设计与分析、中级计量经济学、国际投融资与资本运营、国际营销研究、组织行为与跨文化管理研究、学术论文写作等。（以实际开课为准）</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/PicpAvCuRsQHgBDIibDcjjwjdffxbmMUfM2NF7oVJEywITEyXRko7dh7uIXEkI770lYj8sT79MicpflVoSxQVDFjA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>发展前景</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>Development prospects</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>学院处在粤港澳大湾区、中国（广东）自由贸易试验区建设的战略中心地带，具有独特的地理位置优势和研究特色，加之国际商务的专业优势，未来具有良好的深造和就业前景。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>学院全日制硕士研究生毕业后，部分学生选择继续深造，到国内外知名大学读博士；有部分学生就业于国内外大型知名企业，如</span><span><strong><span>腾讯科技（深圳）有限公司、华为技术有限公司、德勤会计事务所、安永（中国）企业咨询有限公司、毕马威会计事务所、北京师范大学珠海分校、oppo、万科地产、保利地产，中信期货</span></strong></span><span>等；另有部分同学成功考取事业单位、政府部门等。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/PicpAvCuRsQHgBDIibDcjjwjdffxbmMUfM2NF7oVJEywITEyXRko7dh7uIXEkI770lYj8sT79MicpflVoSxQVDFjA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>07</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报考信息</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>Enrollment information</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名详情</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>一、报名申请对象</span></span></strong><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span><span>大陆地区高校优秀本科应届推免生。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>二、报名申请条件与要求</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（一）获得本科学校推荐免试资格，材料齐全，手续完备；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）身心健康，综合素质强；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）具备较好的科研素养与学术潜质，有突出科研表现者优先考虑；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（四）本科毕业专业与申请研究生专业原则上应同属一个一级学科。</span></span><strong><span><span>若跨一级学科，则需提供以下材料：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>    1．书面申请，说明跨专业理由，并提供相关支撑材料，如参加过研究生申请专业的科研项目或取得相关科研成果、选修过相关主干课程（含双学位）等；</span></span></p><p><span><span>    2．本科毕业专业与研究生申请专业各有一名教授的书面推荐信。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（五）原则上每位推免生只在一个专业参加一次复试。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（六）招收直博生条件与要求详见相关复试方案。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>三、报名申请程序</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（一）</span></span><strong><span><span>报名时间：2025年8月21日—9月14日，</span></span></strong><span><span>登陆暨南大学研究生招生信息网—&gt;推免生报名系统，填写并提交个人申请信息表。报名信息确认提交后，不可修改或撤销。 </span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）</span></span><strong><span><span>审核时间：9月8日—9月15日</span></span></strong><span><span>，学校将审核并回复考生是否已获得复试资格，考生可在暨南大学研究生招生信息网推免生报名系统中查询审核结果。 </span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）</span></span><strong><span><span>复试时间：9月17日—9月19日</span></span></strong><span><span>，各专业具体复试要求及日程安排9月10日后详见暨南大学研究生招生信息网。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>四、报名须提交材料 </span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>相关材料扫描电子版在报名系统中提交，清单如下： </span></span></p><p><span><span>（一）《暨南大学2026年接收优秀推荐免试攻读硕士研究生申请表》，报名系统填报信息后生成申请表，须申请人签名； </span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）在校历年学习成绩表，加盖推荐学校教务处公章； </span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）国家英语四级或六级考试成绩； </span></span></p><p><span><span>（四）本人学生证； </span></span></p><p><span><span>（五）证明学生本人在科研方面有突出表现的学术论文等原创性成果材料（该材料不作为必须提供材料，供复试专家组参考）。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>五、关于拟录取 </span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>学校对通过复试并拟录取为我校硕士研究生的推免生发放同意接收函，推免生须按规定时间在中国研究生招生信息网</span></span><strong><span><span>（http://yz.chsi.com.cn/）</span></span></strong><span><span>的推免服务系统完成网上报名确认手续，未在规定时间内完成网上报名确认手续者视为自动放弃，不予录取。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>六、</span></span></strong><span><span>如申请人提供的材料不真实，一经发现则随时取消录取资格，并予以网上通报。</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学费</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>具体各专业学费标准见我校财务处网站学费公示栏</span><strong><span>（http://cwc.jnu.edu.cn/）</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>住宿</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>学校为全日制研究生提供校内宿舍，学校会根据当年宿舍实际安排情况适当调整收费标准。具体住宿费标准见我校财务处网站学费公示栏</span><strong><span>（http://cwc.jnu.edu.cn/）。</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/PicpAvCuRsQHgBDIibDcjjwjdffxbmMUfM2NF7oVJEywITEyXRko7dh7uIXEkI770lYj8sT79MicpflVoSxQVDFjA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>08</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>Contact Us</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>意向报名请加群</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/f4Xy5cnwm8zvTBekiagcGrnm2J4WolLhtdRbqS4xt6Cv2KkavovK2